  "description": "In this unique experience, your mission will not only be to protect yourself from the relentless attacks of your obsessive yandere but also to resist his seductive temptations.\n\nEach encounter will test not only your strategic skills but also the strength of your willpower!\n\nPrepare for a challenge that blends tension, strategy, and dangerous charm.\n\n\nGAME FEATURES:\n\n● Defend yourself from your yandere’s attacks: Use your wits and reflexes to survive his attempts to capture you.\n\n● Resist his charms: Keep control of your mind and heart as he tries to seduce you with his overwhelming presence.\n\n● Unlock new images: Each level cleared reveals a more intense, enigmatic, and seductive side of your yandere.\n\n● Strategy and resilience: Use special abilities and upgrades to stay one step ahead of his obsession.\n\n● Increasing difficulty: With each level, your yandere’s attacks and temptations will become harder to resist.\n\n● The final challenge: Hold out until the last confrontation and prove you won’t fall under his spell!\n\n\nDo you have the strength to face his obsessive love and survive unscathed?\n\nDiscover it and dive into a game where defence has never been so exciting... nor so dangerous!",
